      "full_text": "Rachel M. Hughes Green 84, of Gouldtown, NJ passed away on Monday evening February \n  23, 2015 after a short battle with cancer. A lifelong resident of Gouldtown, \n  she was born July 2, 1930 , the daughter of the late John Romaine and Ariana \n  (nee Gould) Hughes, and the wife of the late Wayne Green.",
